/target
/.lein-*
/.nrepl-port
*.jar
/.clj-kondo/.cache
/.lsp/.cache

# examples/ is governed by examples/.gitignore, which whitelists the sources
# and ignores everything else -- see there for why that direction, and the
# README's "Example" section for the build-into-out/ recipe that keeps
# products out of the source directory in the first place (TASK-50.5).

# A hand-run pdflatex/bibtex from the repo root leaves its byproducts here.
# Listed by extension rather than whitelisted, because the repository root
# cannot be ignored wholesale the way a source directory can. Prefer
# `-output-directory`, which is what makes this list a backstop rather than
# the thing being relied on.
/*.aux
/*.log
/*.out
/*.bbl
/*.blg
/*.pdf
/*.dvi
/*.bib
/*.toc
/*.lof
/*.lot
/*.fls
/*.fdb_latexmk
/*.synctex.gz
